WEBVTT

01:35.770 --> 01:40.620
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.680 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 7]

01:57.920 --> 01:58.590
Awake, huh?

01:59.759 --> 02:01.070
This is

02:01.530 --> 02:02.810
very rude of you.

02:03.350 --> 02:05.790
Wouldn't it be even ruder
if someone else saw this?

02:05.790 --> 02:07.450
I might as well kill you first.

02:07.710 --> 02:09.750
If I silence you, no one will ever know.

02:09.750 --> 02:10.400
Then you should have

02:10.400 --> 02:12.000
done it while I was sleeping.

02:13.550 --> 02:15.750
I don't like taking advantage of people.

02:15.750 --> 02:16.560
Besides,

02:16.790 --> 02:17.520
it would be such a pity

02:17.520 --> 02:19.850
if I didn't get to see you
begging for mercy

02:19.910 --> 02:20.870
before you die.

02:21.750 --> 02:23.030
What a pity indeed—

02:23.910 --> 02:25.280
I've never learned

02:25.280 --> 02:26.600
how to beg anyone for mercy
in my whole life.

02:26.600 --> 02:28.290
Everything can be learned.

02:28.840 --> 02:30.440
You could give it a try today.

02:31.800 --> 02:32.660
Your Highness!

02:44.370 --> 02:45.620
Make him leave.

02:46.250 --> 02:47.070
Hurry up.

02:50.870 --> 02:52.000
Yes, Your Highness!

02:58.560 --> 03:00.800
As long as you don't tell anyone about
what happened last night,

03:00.800 --> 03:02.260
we can still be partners.

03:02.840 --> 03:04.100
What are you thinking?

03:04.360 --> 03:06.020
Nothing happened last night.

03:06.400 --> 03:07.610
I saw you were drunk senseless,

03:07.610 --> 03:09.470
so I just brought you back to rest.

03:10.240 --> 03:11.710
Your looks aren't nearly enough

03:11.710 --> 03:13.150
to catch my eye.

03:14.870 --> 03:16.380
That's for the best.

03:16.910 --> 03:18.710
But whether I kill you or not

03:18.750 --> 03:20.210
depends solely on my mood.

03:20.560 --> 03:23.960
It has nothing to do with what did
or did not happen last night.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.030
Fine.

03:25.710 --> 03:26.310
But could you please

03:26.310 --> 03:27.910
change your position first?

03:27.910 --> 03:29.590
You're making my legs go numb.

03:36.240 --> 03:37.180
How's that?

03:37.520 --> 03:39.250
Holding a knife to someone

03:39.870 --> 03:41.600
feels rather rude, doesn't it?

04:06.670 --> 04:07.960
What's with these lousy clothes?

04:07.960 --> 04:09.220
Messing with my moves.

04:12.190 --> 04:13.520
What are you looking at?

04:13.750 --> 04:14.760
Didn't you leave?

04:18.170 --> 04:19.240
W-Which young lady

04:19.240 --> 04:20.700
is talking to me right now?

04:20.730 --> 04:21.920
When I woke up today,

04:22.000 --> 04:22.720
my vision was all blurry.

04:22.720 --> 04:23.040
I...

04:23.160 --> 04:25.130
I couldn't see a thing.

04:25.160 --> 04:26.690
Then let me fix that for you.

04:30.870 --> 04:31.310
Oh...

04:31.390 --> 04:31.850
What...

04:32.070 --> 04:33.480
What was that just now?

04:35.530 --> 04:37.280
I can't hear anything, either.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.170
You'd better be deaf and mute.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.659
My lips are sealed.

04:55.800 --> 04:56.659
Your Highness.

04:57.830 --> 04:58.480
I...

04:59.270 --> 05:00.380
Get to the point.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.360
Get to the point.

05:03.270 --> 05:05.070
Xia Jingshi has come to Yujing,

05:05.160 --> 05:06.800
saying it's regarding
the marriage alliance.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.930
He'll arrive today.

05:08.920 --> 05:09.780
Your Highness,

05:10.120 --> 05:11.920
are you letting her go just like that?

05:11.920 --> 05:13.310
How about I keep an eye on her for you?

05:13.310 --> 05:14.390
She'll be back.

05:17.390 --> 05:19.390
Is it true that
Prince of Zhennan will arrive

05:19.390 --> 05:20.320
in Yujing today?

05:20.480 --> 05:20.950
This news

05:20.950 --> 05:22.480
came from the morning court session,

05:22.480 --> 05:23.190
so it must be true.

05:23.190 --> 05:23.920
His Majesty has arranged for

05:23.920 --> 05:26.000
the Minister of Rites, Shen Wu,
to receive him.

05:26.000 --> 05:26.860
But I heard that

05:26.870 --> 05:28.680
Prince of Zhennan
isn't bringing many attendants with him.

05:28.680 --> 05:30.310
Does my brother know about this?

05:30.310 --> 05:31.210
What did he say?

05:31.800 --> 05:32.630
I haven't heard

05:32.630 --> 05:34.360
any news from the First Prince.

05:42.720 --> 05:45.390
Your Highness. His Highness
the Second Prince is here.

05:45.390 --> 05:46.170
Sister.

05:48.870 --> 05:49.560
Guess what gift

05:49.560 --> 05:50.850
I've prepared for you?

05:51.630 --> 05:53.800
Well, well.
You're not focusing on your studies

05:53.800 --> 05:55.560
and instead spending time
preparing gifts for me.

05:55.560 --> 05:57.310
Be careful, Father might punish you
if he finds out.

05:57.310 --> 05:58.440
If Father finds out,

05:58.480 --> 06:00.000
he might even praise me
for being thoughtful.

06:00.000 --> 06:01.130
Come on, bring it up.

06:01.240 --> 06:02.370
Be careful. Slowly.

06:05.510 --> 06:07.110
Sister, come check this out.

06:07.450 --> 06:09.310
This is what I specially prepared for you:

06:09.310 --> 06:11.040
a hundred-year-old walnut tree.

06:11.040 --> 06:14.120
It symbolizes a harmonious marriage
lasting 100 years,

06:14.120 --> 06:16.720
specially chosen to wish you
a joyful wedding.

06:16.880 --> 06:18.270
I'll take it then.

06:18.560 --> 06:19.820
Thank you, Chengyang.

06:20.160 --> 06:21.040
What wonderful gift

06:21.040 --> 06:22.600
did Brother prepare for you?

06:22.600 --> 06:24.160
Brother has always adored you the most.

06:24.160 --> 06:25.240
He must have given you

06:25.240 --> 06:27.770
all sorts of
strange little trinkets, right?

06:28.560 --> 06:29.070
Sister,

06:29.450 --> 06:30.980
where did you put his gifts?

06:42.680 --> 06:43.390
Brother...

06:44.390 --> 06:46.450
He didn't forget to you a gift, did he?

06:48.600 --> 06:50.659
He doesn't approve of your marriage?

06:53.360 --> 06:55.630
Nothing gets past you, does it?

06:56.290 --> 06:57.080
Oh no.

06:58.590 --> 07:00.000
Brother didn't give you any wedding gift,

07:00.000 --> 07:00.750
and here I am,

07:00.800 --> 07:02.120
as your little brother
making such a grand gesture.

07:02.120 --> 07:02.630
Sister,

07:03.630 --> 07:05.630
as for this walnut tree...

07:05.650 --> 07:08.050
I'll just pretend I never saw
or heard of it.

07:08.070 --> 07:10.000
I appreciate the thought, though.

07:10.120 --> 07:11.710
You can take the gift back.

07:11.800 --> 07:12.600
Don't worry.

07:12.680 --> 07:13.890
I won't mind.

07:14.560 --> 07:15.190
But what if Brother

07:15.190 --> 07:16.270
just won't agree?

07:16.270 --> 07:16.750
What then?

07:16.750 --> 07:18.280
I will marry Xia Jingshi.

07:21.270 --> 07:21.870
Sister,

07:22.560 --> 07:24.360
I just remembered

07:24.390 --> 07:25.950
I still have homework to do today.

07:25.950 --> 07:27.830
I'll take my leave now.

07:30.000 --> 07:30.800
Come on. Move it away.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.070
Yes.

07:31.070 --> 07:31.600
Hurry up.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.100
I take my leave.

07:53.000 --> 07:54.040
Let me out!

07:54.390 --> 07:55.720
Let me out of here!

07:55.870 --> 07:56.550
Xueying!

07:57.240 --> 07:58.040
Sister!

07:58.480 --> 07:59.530
Don't come closer! Go away!

07:59.530 --> 08:00.590
What's happening?

08:01.870 --> 08:02.310
Yesterday,

08:02.310 --> 08:03.950
right after I brought the kids here,

08:03.950 --> 08:04.510
these

08:04.510 --> 08:05.290
unreasonable bastards

08:05.290 --> 08:06.270
sealed off the residence

08:06.270 --> 08:08.000
and wouldn't let anyone leave.

08:09.240 --> 08:10.640
I know who's behind this.

08:10.780 --> 08:11.680
Don't be afraid.

08:11.680 --> 08:13.010
Wait for me to come back.

08:13.920 --> 08:14.510
Sister!

08:31.730 --> 08:33.059
What's your intention?

08:33.390 --> 08:34.750
If you want to eat, have a seat.

08:34.750 --> 08:35.950
If not, keep quiet.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.150
I hate being disturbed

08:37.150 --> 08:38.610
while I'm eating the most.

08:39.360 --> 08:41.159
So you knew about this all along.

08:41.750 --> 08:42.510
Knew what?

08:43.669 --> 08:44.600
Don't play dumb.

08:45.000 --> 08:46.030
Xueying's residence

08:46.030 --> 08:47.270
is being closely watched,

08:47.270 --> 08:48.790
allowing people in but not out.

08:48.790 --> 08:50.030
I was wondering which bastard

08:50.030 --> 08:50.910
did it.

08:51.390 --> 08:52.920
Turns out it really was you.

08:57.120 --> 08:59.250
Miss Yixiao, you're in quite a temper.

08:59.600 --> 09:00.630
It seems none of the dishes on this table

09:00.630 --> 09:01.750
are to your taste.

09:02.390 --> 09:03.960
But whether they suit your taste or not
doesn't matter.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.750
As long as they suit mine,
that's what counts.

09:05.750 --> 09:06.720
Yesterday, you said it yourself

09:06.720 --> 09:07.670
that you'd let me go,

09:07.670 --> 09:08.630
but now you've gone back on your word

09:08.630 --> 09:09.600
and broken your promise.

09:09.600 --> 09:11.360
What exactly are you playing at?

09:11.360 --> 09:13.220
I'm protecting you guys.

09:13.320 --> 09:14.910
Why can't you appreciate
my good intentions?

09:14.910 --> 09:15.720
Protecting?

09:15.790 --> 09:17.520
This is clearly imprisonment!

09:20.080 --> 09:21.330
Imprisonment?

09:22.270 --> 09:23.290
The entire Yujing City

09:23.290 --> 09:24.290
is my territory,

09:24.360 --> 09:25.720
all under my control.

09:25.790 --> 09:27.120
And you're someone I brought back myself.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.980
Would I even need to imprison you?

09:29.910 --> 09:32.270
Can you possibly escape from my grasp?

09:34.270 --> 09:35.950
As my defeated opponent,

09:36.480 --> 09:38.340
you sure have quite the attitude.

09:39.320 --> 09:40.100
Looks like

09:40.870 --> 09:42.240
you don't want to cooperate after all.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.240
Of course I do.

09:43.670 --> 09:44.870
But it has to be me

09:45.360 --> 09:46.550
who sets the ground rules.

09:46.550 --> 09:47.360
You have your rules,

09:47.360 --> 09:48.290
and I have mine.

09:48.390 --> 09:49.870
It's not solely up to you.

09:56.960 --> 09:57.820
Your Highness.

10:15.030 --> 10:16.270
All our men in the Feng Battalion know

10:16.270 --> 10:17.960
that Susha is to form a marriage alliance
with Jinxiu.

10:17.960 --> 10:18.630
Somehow a rumor has spread,

10:18.630 --> 10:19.480
saying that Your Highness

10:19.480 --> 10:20.910
opposes the marriage alliance,

10:20.910 --> 10:22.240
and that His Majesty is going to
strip you of your military command.

10:22.240 --> 10:23.880
Our men are furious

10:24.000 --> 10:25.320
and threaten to confront the court.

10:25.320 --> 10:27.360
I fear a mutiny may break out
in the ranks.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.290
Utter nonsense!

10:29.240 --> 10:30.800
Order all Military Commanders
and Deputy Generals

10:30.800 --> 10:32.330
to come see me immediately.

10:32.670 --> 10:33.360
Yes, Your Highness.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.320
Go find out

10:34.510 --> 10:36.600
exactly who's trying to
undermine army morale.

10:36.600 --> 10:38.020
Those deliberately spreading rumors

10:38.020 --> 10:39.290
must not be spared.

10:39.510 --> 10:40.640
Yes, Your Highness.

10:56.910 --> 10:59.030
The Feng Battalion
has always had iron discipline

10:59.030 --> 11:00.910
and stands as the model
for all the armies.

11:00.910 --> 11:03.200
Every soldier faithfully
fulfills their duties

11:03.200 --> 11:04.290
and obeys orders.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.080
Now it's said the army

11:06.080 --> 11:08.360
is restless with signs of mutiny,

11:09.150 --> 11:10.270
but I don't believe it.

11:10.270 --> 11:11.120
If you ask me,

11:12.820 --> 11:13.840
it must be you

11:13.840 --> 11:16.370
leading officers
whose hearts are wavering.

11:20.670 --> 11:21.670
Everyone here

11:23.000 --> 11:23.670
has been through

11:23.670 --> 11:25.710
life and death alongside me.

11:26.200 --> 11:28.130
There are no outsiders here today.

11:28.320 --> 11:30.000
If you have any complaints,

11:30.000 --> 11:32.530
please speak up freely
and hold nothing back.

11:34.750 --> 11:35.610
Your Highness,

11:36.200 --> 11:38.120
there's one thing I don't understand.

11:38.120 --> 11:39.150
Susha and Jinxiu

11:39.200 --> 11:40.200
have such deep-seated hatred,

11:40.200 --> 11:42.080
and now, all of a sudden, we are to form
a marriage alliance to seek peace.

11:42.080 --> 11:42.880
Could it be...

11:42.960 --> 11:43.600
Could it be because

11:43.600 --> 11:44.790
we lost the battle at Pingling City

11:44.790 --> 11:47.050
that we must humble ourselves for peace?

11:47.080 --> 11:48.200
I believe this is the very question

11:48.200 --> 11:49.980
on all of your minds.

11:50.080 --> 11:52.240
That battle at Pingling City was fought
by us.

11:52.240 --> 11:54.510
If this marriage alliance
is because we lost,

11:54.510 --> 11:55.400
then how can I

11:56.270 --> 11:57.870
face all my brothers in arms?

11:58.270 --> 11:59.240
Utter nonsense!

12:00.030 --> 12:02.030
A marriage alliance between two kingdoms
is such a momentous matter,

12:02.030 --> 12:03.510
affecting the major affairs
of both kingdoms.

12:03.510 --> 12:04.390
How could it be determined

12:04.390 --> 12:05.450
by a single battle?

12:05.630 --> 12:06.960
Besides, let's be clear—

12:06.960 --> 12:08.720
it was Jinxiu that proposed
this marriage alliance.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.310
Why?

12:09.550 --> 12:10.720
Because they chickened out.

12:10.720 --> 12:12.360
They don't dare fight us anymore.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.720
They want to use the Battle of Pingling

12:13.720 --> 12:14.480
as a graceful exit,

12:14.480 --> 12:16.480
and that's why they came to us
with this marriage alliance proposal.

12:16.480 --> 12:18.670
It was Emperor of Jinxiu
who proposed the marriage alliance,

12:18.670 --> 12:19.840
yet you're all

12:19.840 --> 12:20.790
sulking and feeling resentful here.

12:20.790 --> 12:22.000
What are you trying to do?

12:22.000 --> 12:23.510
Are you trying to force His Highness
to rebel?

12:23.510 --> 12:24.080
Enough!

12:26.240 --> 12:28.300
You only need to remember two things.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.330
First,

12:29.720 --> 12:31.670
the defeat of Battle of Pingling
was my fault.

12:31.670 --> 12:33.630
None of our soldiers in the Feng Battalion
are to blame.

12:33.630 --> 12:34.750
Your Highness, how could it be your fault?

12:34.750 --> 12:35.390
Second,

12:36.030 --> 12:37.960
regarding the marriage alliance,

12:38.390 --> 12:39.450
I have agreed to it.

12:43.090 --> 12:44.790
I understand

12:45.270 --> 12:47.030
any grievances our soldiers may have,

12:47.030 --> 12:48.760
and I'll take responsibility.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.670
Any resentment our soldiers feel,

12:50.670 --> 12:52.270
let it be counted against me.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.510
But you must tell everyone

12:54.530 --> 12:56.480
that His Majesty has not stripped me
of my military power,

12:56.480 --> 12:58.260
and no one at court
is plotting against me.

12:58.260 --> 13:00.050
The weapons of our Feng Battalion

13:00.050 --> 13:01.510
will only ever be pointed at our enemies,

13:01.510 --> 13:02.840
never at our own people,

13:02.870 --> 13:04.870
and mutiny will never be tolerated!

13:05.000 --> 13:06.130
Yes, Your Highness!

13:14.680 --> 13:17.030
Your Highness,
I have urgent news to report.

13:17.030 --> 13:17.660
Speak.

13:23.720 --> 13:24.780
Yun Qing's dagger?

13:26.240 --> 13:27.460
This is the dagger
you previously awarded to Yun Qing.

13:27.460 --> 13:28.360
He values it more than his life

13:28.360 --> 13:29.690
and never parts with it.

13:29.870 --> 13:31.120
How did it end up with you?

13:31.120 --> 13:31.870
Your Highness,

13:31.870 --> 13:32.510
Yun Qing quietly left

13:32.510 --> 13:34.080
the camp early this morning.

13:34.080 --> 13:35.200
He left this dagger

13:35.220 --> 13:37.080
with a message for Your Highness,

13:37.080 --> 13:39.910
that he intends to kill someone
on Your Highness's behalf,

13:39.910 --> 13:42.410
and that he's failed you in this life

13:42.600 --> 13:44.240
and wasted your cultivation.

13:44.240 --> 13:46.100
Is he leaving the Feng Battalion?

13:46.600 --> 13:47.400
You may leave.

13:47.870 --> 13:48.320
Yes.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.670
What does he mean?

13:51.670 --> 13:52.960
Who does he want to kill?

13:52.960 --> 13:54.160
You said this morning

13:54.320 --> 13:56.520
that Xia Jingshi is arriving in Yujing?

13:56.870 --> 13:58.500
Yes, he's arriving today.

14:01.800 --> 14:05.910
[Yujing Border]

14:11.480 --> 14:13.210
He intends to kill Xia Jingshi?

14:13.610 --> 14:16.270
Xia Jingshi is coming for
the marriage alliance.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.600
If he dies in Yujing,

14:17.960 --> 14:18.980
Susha will be accused

14:18.980 --> 14:20.440
of betrayal and dishonor,

14:21.000 --> 14:23.400
and Yun Qing's crime will be unforgivable.

14:24.510 --> 14:26.150
Please, Your Highness, save Yun Qing.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.720
Yun Qing is completely loyal
to Your Highness.

14:27.720 --> 14:28.390
He knows that Your Highness

14:28.390 --> 14:29.910
cannot kill Xia Jingshi yourself,

14:29.910 --> 14:31.570
so he wants to kill him for you.

14:31.960 --> 14:33.980
How can he be so foolish?

14:34.240 --> 14:35.030
If he does this,

14:35.030 --> 14:35.720
isn't he just giving up

14:35.720 --> 14:36.790
all his hard-earned military achievements

14:36.790 --> 14:38.250
and his promising future?

14:42.640 --> 14:44.370
Yun Qing is your sworn brother,

14:44.920 --> 14:46.790
but he's also like a little brother to me.

14:46.790 --> 14:47.520
Don't worry.

14:47.910 --> 14:50.040
I'll definitely find a way to stop him.

14:50.120 --> 14:50.720
But...

14:51.200 --> 14:52.060
Your Highness,

14:52.550 --> 14:53.530
Yun Qing is the best archer

14:53.530 --> 14:54.620
in our battalion,

14:54.650 --> 14:55.990
and he knows the terrain well.

14:55.990 --> 14:58.520
If he wants to kill Xia Jingshi,
I'm afraid...

14:59.200 --> 14:59.730
Besides,

15:00.510 --> 15:02.110
where would we even find him?

15:11.870 --> 15:13.070
Why should I help you?

15:14.000 --> 15:15.630
As long as you help me find him,

15:15.630 --> 15:16.960
you can name your price.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.670
I have no price to name,

15:19.670 --> 15:21.330
and I don't have that ability.

15:22.010 --> 15:23.080
Although you've lost

15:23.080 --> 15:24.540
the strength to draw a bow,

15:25.080 --> 15:26.360
you still have an archer's keen eyes

15:26.360 --> 15:27.660
and experience.

15:27.690 --> 15:28.870
Well, I'm flattered.

15:28.870 --> 15:30.000
Yun Qing doesn't know

15:30.000 --> 15:31.790
Xia Jingshi's exact time of arrival
in Yujing,

15:31.790 --> 15:33.030
so he can only lie in wait

15:33.030 --> 15:34.520
for Xia Jingshi to appear.

15:34.630 --> 15:36.170
The most secure position to strike

15:36.170 --> 15:37.700
would be near the city gate.

15:37.750 --> 15:39.120
The terrain outside the city gate
is too open,

15:39.120 --> 15:40.630
leaving Yun Qing nowhere to hide,

15:40.630 --> 15:42.560
so he can only stay inside the gate.

15:43.240 --> 15:44.550
What you need to do is simple:

15:44.550 --> 15:45.480
just tell me

15:45.500 --> 15:47.580
if you were to assassinate Xia Jingshi,

15:47.580 --> 15:49.380
what position would you choose?

15:49.960 --> 15:51.790
If it's really as simple as you say,

15:51.790 --> 15:53.390
then why bother coming to me?

15:53.550 --> 15:54.360
I'm sure there are

15:54.360 --> 15:55.720
plenty of skilled archers

15:55.720 --> 15:56.270
in your army as well.

15:56.270 --> 15:57.550
You probably don't know that

15:57.550 --> 15:58.510
Yun Qing is considered Susha's

15:58.510 --> 15:59.840
most formidable archer.

15:59.840 --> 16:01.080
Ordinary archers can't even imagine

16:01.080 --> 16:02.610
how formidable he truly is.

16:02.870 --> 16:03.600
Miss Yixiao,

16:04.120 --> 16:04.720
you are

16:04.720 --> 16:05.840
the greatest archer in the world.

16:05.840 --> 16:06.910
Right now, only you can guess

16:06.910 --> 16:08.710
what Yun Qing might be thinking.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.630
I'm not nearly as skilled as you say.

16:10.630 --> 16:12.160
It's not worth mentioning.

16:12.610 --> 16:14.800
See how good he is with words?

16:15.510 --> 16:17.970
When asking for help,
one should act like it.

16:20.080 --> 16:22.020
Tell me, what are your conditions?

16:22.120 --> 16:23.650
I can agree to three of them.

16:24.420 --> 16:26.280
That's not what you said just now.

16:33.760 --> 16:34.210
Fine.

16:35.910 --> 16:38.010
Five it is.

16:41.870 --> 16:43.620
"The entire Yujing City

16:43.960 --> 16:45.390
is my territory.

16:46.000 --> 16:48.240
Everything's under my control."

16:48.630 --> 16:50.750
First Prince,
you're truly impressive, huh?

16:50.750 --> 16:51.690
If you're really that impressive,

16:51.690 --> 16:53.690
how come you can't even find someone

16:53.960 --> 16:55.090
when you want to?

16:55.790 --> 16:58.360
Leave some leeway in your dealings.

16:58.510 --> 16:59.940
Don't push things too far,

16:59.940 --> 17:01.630
and always leave yourself a way out.

17:01.630 --> 17:02.570
Don't you agree?

17:04.790 --> 17:05.589
What's wrong?

17:05.740 --> 17:07.069
You look

17:07.069 --> 17:08.589
quite reluctant, First Prince.

17:08.589 --> 17:09.960
I've agreed to help you,

17:10.200 --> 17:12.060
yet you didn't even say thank you.

17:12.960 --> 17:13.740
Thank you.

17:15.160 --> 17:16.290
That's more like it.

17:17.200 --> 17:18.349
As for the first condition...

17:18.349 --> 17:19.819
The guards at Miss Ling's residence

17:19.819 --> 17:20.920
will be withdrawn.

17:24.829 --> 17:25.480
Alright.

17:25.520 --> 17:26.880
I haven't thought of the other four yet.

17:26.880 --> 17:27.960
Let's leave those pending for now.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.620
Give me the map of Yujing City.

17:32.960 --> 17:33.540
What?

17:33.680 --> 17:34.350
Afraid I'll sneak a look at

17:34.350 --> 17:35.570
your secret maps?

17:35.750 --> 17:37.160
Forget it if you won't share.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.490
The maps are in my study.

17:38.510 --> 17:39.240
Come with me.

17:43.590 --> 17:44.320
Miss Yixiao.

17:44.720 --> 17:45.720
Xia Jingshi and his party

17:45.720 --> 17:47.640
set off from the post station
at the border early this morning.

17:47.640 --> 17:49.180
They should arrive in Yujing

17:49.180 --> 17:50.640
in no more than four hours.

17:51.050 --> 17:52.900
This is the gate
where Xia Jingshi will enter the city.

17:51.980 --> 17:55.550
[West Gate] [Post Station]

17:53.070 --> 17:54.240
Then he'll follow this road

17:54.240 --> 17:55.970
all the way to the post station.

17:56.240 --> 17:58.000
What kind of bow does Yun Qing use?

17:58.000 --> 17:59.800
He took a two-picul bow with him.

18:00.350 --> 18:01.590
His archery skills are such that

18:01.590 --> 18:03.240
within 100 paces, he never misses;

18:03.240 --> 18:04.720
at 150 paces, he hits 6 or 7 out of 10;

18:04.720 --> 18:06.600
and at 180 paces, 3 or 4 out of 10.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.750
We've already sent people

18:07.750 --> 18:09.030
to search along the route
from the city gate to the post station,

18:09.030 --> 18:10.310
within a range of 100 to 150 paces

18:10.310 --> 18:11.370
on either side,

18:11.450 --> 18:13.080
but we still couldn't find Yun Qing.

18:13.080 --> 18:14.700
Should we expand the search area?

18:14.700 --> 18:15.900
There's no time left.

18:16.250 --> 18:17.320
[West Gate] [Tea House]

18:16.750 --> 18:18.080
How far is this position

18:18.270 --> 18:19.330
from the city gate?

18:20.150 --> 18:21.210
Just over 50 paces.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.340
That's enough.

18:22.900 --> 18:24.190
Are you suggesting

18:24.680 --> 18:26.940
Yun Qing would choose a closer position?

18:27.240 --> 18:27.920
He knew you would

18:27.920 --> 18:28.960
try to stop him,

18:29.310 --> 18:30.240
so he deliberately took

18:30.240 --> 18:31.340
a two-picul bow.

18:31.790 --> 18:33.270
But have you considered that

18:33.270 --> 18:35.170
a two-picul bow is so large,

18:35.270 --> 18:37.000
and bringing it to a crowded area

18:37.000 --> 18:38.240
would make him too conspicuous?

18:38.240 --> 18:39.000
With so many of you searching

18:39.000 --> 18:40.070
and still not finding him,

18:40.070 --> 18:41.130
it shows that he has

18:41.200 --> 18:42.110
concealed his whereabouts

18:42.110 --> 18:43.040
extremely well.

18:44.160 --> 18:46.470
Yun Qing only took a two-picul bow

18:46.720 --> 18:48.210
to deceive us,

18:48.830 --> 18:50.110
to make us misjudge

18:50.130 --> 18:51.150
his position.

18:52.030 --> 18:53.480
There's an archery shop here.

18:53.220 --> 18:54.030
[Archery Shop]

18:54.360 --> 18:55.440
[Archery Shop]

18:56.870 --> 18:57.680
He must have bought

18:57.680 --> 18:58.790
a new bow here.

18:59.830 --> 19:00.480
When Yun Qing left,

19:00.480 --> 19:02.010
he left his personal token.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.750
This shows that after the assassination,

19:04.750 --> 19:06.430
he doesn't want to implicate
the Feng Battalion,

19:06.430 --> 19:07.200
so he surely wouldn't use

19:07.200 --> 19:09.030
a Feng Battalion bow for the killing.

19:09.030 --> 19:09.920
The bows from the archery shop

19:09.550 --> 19:11.590
[Archery Shop]

19:09.920 --> 19:11.000
may be crudely made

19:11.110 --> 19:12.970
with a range of no more than 50 paces,

19:12.970 --> 19:13.750
but for

19:13.750 --> 19:14.830
a master archer,

19:15.160 --> 19:16.240
50 paces is more than enough

19:16.240 --> 19:18.310
for him to be confident
he can make a lethal shot.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.150
Besides,

19:19.410 --> 19:20.440
Yun Qing is ready

19:20.480 --> 19:21.330
to die anyway.

19:21.400 --> 19:22.600
He only wants to kill,

19:22.790 --> 19:24.420
with no intention of escaping,

19:24.420 --> 19:26.880
so he doesn't have to leave himself
a way out.

19:29.240 --> 19:29.900
Therefore,

19:30.310 --> 19:31.200
if it were me,

19:31.880 --> 19:33.890
I would choose this tavern.

19:33.110 --> 19:34.290
[Tavern]

19:58.200 --> 19:59.480
Who are these people?

19:59.550 --> 20:00.960
How dare they act on the street?

20:00.960 --> 20:01.950
How bold of them!

20:02.400 --> 20:05.460
Looks like they're from
the First Prince's Residence.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.520
Indeed.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.810
Did something happen?

20:26.160 --> 20:26.820
Yun Qing!

20:26.240 --> 20:29.110
[Susha Kingdom's Feng Battalion, Yun Qing]

20:27.530 --> 20:28.640
Get down here now!

20:29.000 --> 20:29.530
Yun Qing,

20:29.960 --> 20:31.270
this is His Highness's military order!

20:31.270 --> 20:31.960
Are you even refusing

20:31.960 --> 20:33.360
to obey His Highness now?

21:01.600 --> 21:02.230
Yun Qing.

21:04.030 --> 21:06.030
Your name was given by His Highness,

21:06.340 --> 21:08.240
your skills were taught by His Highness,

21:08.240 --> 21:09.350
your position in the Feng Battalion

21:09.350 --> 21:10.790
was arranged by His Highness,

21:10.790 --> 21:11.680
and your life

21:11.720 --> 21:12.680
was saved by His Highness

21:12.680 --> 21:14.270
from among the refugees.

21:14.920 --> 21:16.520
Have you forgotten all this?

21:17.550 --> 21:21.410
I, Yun Qing, would never dare
forget Your Highness's great kindness.

21:23.240 --> 21:25.080
Is what you did today

21:25.830 --> 21:27.400
meant to force me

21:27.400 --> 21:29.110
to collect your corpse myself?

21:29.110 --> 21:29.970
Your Highness.

21:30.350 --> 21:31.280
I only know

21:31.750 --> 21:32.720
that in your heart, you would never agree

21:32.720 --> 21:34.510
to the marriage alliance with Jinxiu.

21:34.510 --> 21:35.920
I only wanted to kill Xia Jingshi

21:35.920 --> 21:37.000
to ease Your Highness's burden.

21:37.000 --> 21:39.330
Have you thought about the consequences?

21:39.480 --> 21:40.720
You wanted to trade your life

21:40.720 --> 21:42.260
for Xia Jingshi's life—

21:42.480 --> 21:43.940
would I ever agree to that?

21:44.270 --> 21:46.210
What is Xia Jingshi anyway?

21:46.640 --> 21:47.960
Is his miserable life

21:48.160 --> 21:50.190
worth trading yours for?

21:57.310 --> 21:57.960
On the first day I brought you

21:57.960 --> 21:59.540
into the Feng Battalion,

22:00.510 --> 22:03.070
what was the military discipline
I ordered you to uphold?

22:03.070 --> 22:04.480
Honor heaven above,

22:05.160 --> 22:06.560
respect the earth below.

22:07.000 --> 22:08.590
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

22:08.590 --> 22:10.050
and never fail the people.

22:11.880 --> 22:13.940
Be loyal to the ruler and the kingdom,

22:14.590 --> 22:16.050
and never fail the people.

22:17.110 --> 22:19.710
This isn't about being loyal to me,
Feng Suige,

22:20.270 --> 22:22.600
nor is it about not failing me,
Feng Suige.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.300
I taught you skills

22:25.030 --> 22:26.240
so that one day

22:26.240 --> 22:27.840
you could serve our kingdom—

22:28.550 --> 22:30.080
not to repay me personally.

22:30.750 --> 22:31.810
Do you understand?

22:33.030 --> 22:33.690
I, Yun Qing,

22:34.350 --> 22:35.480
will remember that.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.480
Get back and report

22:45.000 --> 22:47.000
before the camp is dismissed today.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.850
Yes, Your Highness.

22:54.490 --> 22:55.700
If you dare to be late,

22:57.110 --> 22:59.040
you'll face military punishment.

23:59.160 --> 24:00.000
Thank you

24:01.030 --> 24:02.160
for your help today.

24:04.720 --> 24:06.920
When will Xia Jingshi arrive in Yujing?

24:10.260 --> 24:11.640
The officials of the Ministry of Rites

24:11.640 --> 24:13.110
have gone to the city gate to welcome him.

24:13.110 --> 24:14.450
He should arrive soon.

24:15.510 --> 24:16.480
I just saw Lu Ke

24:16.480 --> 24:18.200
preparing your military robe.

24:18.200 --> 24:18.880
It seems

24:19.300 --> 24:21.240
you're also going to the city tower.

24:21.240 --> 24:22.160
Xia Jingshi

24:22.200 --> 24:23.800
is not that important.

24:23.880 --> 24:24.480
I'm only going

24:24.480 --> 24:25.680
to support my sister.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.410
I'll go with you.

24:28.720 --> 24:29.680
What if there are others

24:29.680 --> 24:31.460
who want to assassinate Xia Jingshi?

24:31.460 --> 24:32.390
Take me with you,

24:32.540 --> 24:33.770
so I can help you spot

24:33.790 --> 24:35.450
if there are other assassins.

24:36.000 --> 24:38.330
You just want to go see Xia Jingshi,
right?

24:41.070 --> 24:42.000
Actually,

24:42.370 --> 24:43.760
I'm quite curious too.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.720
If Xia Jingshi sees you

24:45.770 --> 24:46.750
and discovers that you're now

24:46.750 --> 24:48.490
a concubine in my household,

24:48.640 --> 24:49.950
how would he react?

24:50.830 --> 24:52.000
So you agree?

25:11.530 --> 25:15.310
[Yujing City]

25:35.990 --> 25:37.640
Here they come. Stay alert!

25:43.020 --> 25:44.200
[Yujing City]

25:57.920 --> 26:00.380
It was you who rescued me
from the death camp.

26:00.390 --> 26:01.260
From now on,

26:01.790 --> 26:02.920
my life belongs to you.

26:02.660 --> 26:03.760
[Uphold Virtue to Honor the Ancients]

26:17.960 --> 26:18.820
I, Xiao Weiran—

26:18.850 --> 26:19.640
I, Fu Yixiao—

26:19.660 --> 26:20.410
I, Ning Fei—

26:20.250 --> 26:22.470
[Nan]

26:20.480 --> 26:22.630
From this day on, join the Zhennan Army

26:22.720 --> 26:24.410
and swear loyalty unto death
to His Highness!

26:24.410 --> 26:26.150
Those who kill the people of Jinxiu,

26:26.150 --> 26:28.440
I shall devour their flesh
and drink their blood!

26:28.440 --> 26:30.750
Those who slay even one soldier
of the Zhennan Army,

26:30.750 --> 26:31.960
I shall execute without mercy!

26:31.960 --> 26:32.920
Kill!

26:33.550 --> 26:34.550
Kill!

26:36.200 --> 26:37.480
With this as my betrothal gift,

26:37.480 --> 26:39.550
Heaven and earth as witness,
mountains and rivers as matchmakers,

26:39.550 --> 26:42.000
I vow to stay by your side till death.

26:42.070 --> 26:43.200
Would you be willing

26:43.350 --> 26:45.490
to marry me in your bridal finery?

26:51.720 --> 26:52.520
What's wrong?

26:57.200 --> 26:58.720
I will share life and death
with Your Highness!

26:58.720 --> 27:00.120
This is a military order!

27:02.690 --> 27:03.640
Protect His Highness!

27:03.640 --> 27:04.900
Protect His Highness!

27:24.090 --> 27:26.640
[Yujing City]

27:24.550 --> 27:26.820
I am Shen Wu, Minister of Rites.

27:26.920 --> 27:28.510
Prince of Zhennan, you've come from afar.

27:28.510 --> 27:30.440
The journey must have been tiring.

27:30.550 --> 27:33.080
Minister Shen, no need for
such formalities.

27:34.110 --> 27:36.480
Prince of Zhennan,
please follow me to the carriage.

27:36.480 --> 27:38.000
His Majesty is waiting for you.

27:38.000 --> 27:39.790
The rest of you,
please follow the ceremonial officer

27:39.790 --> 27:41.200
to the post station to rest.

27:41.200 --> 27:43.240
I will accompany you, Prince of Zhennan,

27:43.240 --> 27:44.560
into the palace to have an audience
with His Majesty first.

27:43.670 --> 27:45.300
[Yujing City]

28:48.200 --> 28:49.730
Prince of Zhennan, please.

28:59.030 --> 29:00.000
Let's go.

29:22.900 --> 29:23.780
Fu Yixiao.

29:25.610 --> 29:27.340
Did something come back to you?

29:32.000 --> 29:34.640
[Peace]

29:41.040 --> 29:42.370
Stop thinking about it.

29:42.720 --> 29:44.040
Loosen your grip,

29:45.720 --> 29:46.350
will you?

29:50.800 --> 29:51.570
Alright?

29:53.400 --> 29:55.220
No one here will hurt you.

29:55.910 --> 29:57.240
Loosen your grip first.

30:12.190 --> 30:13.700
Do you remember who I am?

30:19.230 --> 30:20.600
Half a smile,

30:21.710 --> 30:23.170
half a sneer—

30:23.450 --> 30:24.950
just like you.

30:26.930 --> 30:28.200
Feng Suige.

30:31.270 --> 30:32.200
Yes, it's me.

30:42.980 --> 30:43.750
Bastard!

30:43.750 --> 30:44.760
Don't push!

31:00.350 --> 31:01.810
Such simple folk customs.

31:01.830 --> 31:03.430
Simple folk customs indeed.

31:08.970 --> 31:11.180
My husband and son

31:11.310 --> 31:12.310
were both killed

31:12.310 --> 31:14.420
by you Jinxiu people!

31:14.750 --> 31:17.110
How dare you come to Yujing?

31:17.400 --> 31:20.250
May you die a terrible death!

31:20.780 --> 31:23.310
A terrible death!

31:25.830 --> 31:27.920
You executioners!

31:39.550 --> 31:42.580
[Palace of Susha Kingdom]

32:08.890 --> 32:10.670
By order of our Emperor,

32:10.840 --> 32:11.990
I have come to Susha

32:12.030 --> 32:13.490
to marry Princess Xiyang.

32:13.550 --> 32:14.690
Our Emperor

32:14.920 --> 32:16.090
sincerely wishes

32:16.200 --> 32:18.160
for lasting friendship
between our two kingdoms

32:18.160 --> 32:21.290
and for the people to enjoy
a life of peace and stability.

32:22.110 --> 32:23.490
In times of war,

32:23.790 --> 32:26.120
it's always the common people who suffer.

32:26.240 --> 32:26.720
I,

32:27.640 --> 32:29.490
like the Emperor of Jinxiu,

32:29.830 --> 32:33.070
wish for peace throughout the land.

32:35.160 --> 32:37.160
Your Majesty, please rest assured.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.890
Princess Xiyang and I

32:39.000 --> 32:41.510
will do everything to maintain peace
between our two kingdoms.

32:41.510 --> 32:42.350
I was worried

32:42.350 --> 32:44.480
about Xiyang marrying into a foreign land,

32:44.480 --> 32:45.460
but today,

32:45.590 --> 32:47.350
seeing your fine character,
Prince of Zhennan,

32:47.350 --> 32:49.890
I feel much more at ease.

32:50.110 --> 32:50.970
In the future,

32:51.110 --> 32:52.850
I hope you will treat each other
with respect

32:52.850 --> 32:54.440
and live in harmony.

32:55.880 --> 32:56.680
Your Majesty,

32:56.960 --> 32:59.200
I've obtained permission from our Emperor

32:59.200 --> 33:00.110
to return all Susha warriors

33:00.110 --> 33:01.850
we captured

33:02.000 --> 33:03.400
in the Battle of Pingling,

33:03.400 --> 33:05.510
hoping our kingdoms will maintain
friendly relations for centuries

33:05.510 --> 33:07.770
and lasting peace throughout the world.

33:08.160 --> 33:10.400
It's thoughtful of you, Prince of Zhennan.

33:10.400 --> 33:11.530
When the time comes,

33:11.960 --> 33:13.500
all Jinxiu prisoners

33:13.590 --> 33:15.240
will be handed over to you

33:15.830 --> 33:17.490
and return with you to Jinxiu.

33:19.200 --> 33:20.600
Thank you, Your Majesty.

33:21.590 --> 33:23.880
Now that the two kingdoms
have ceased hostilities and made peace,

33:23.880 --> 33:25.520
Prince of Zhennan and Xiyang

33:25.590 --> 33:26.920
deserve much credit.

33:39.030 --> 33:41.030
This way please, Prince of Zhennan.

33:50.920 --> 33:51.750
Your Majesty.

34:02.790 --> 34:03.450
Please sit.

34:09.280 --> 34:10.550
Bring some wine.

34:11.320 --> 34:12.070
Your Majesty,

34:12.070 --> 34:14.590
it's not yet noon,
not suitable for drinking.

34:14.590 --> 34:16.590
I'm meeting my future son-in-law.

34:17.070 --> 34:18.730
Doesn't that deserve a drink?

34:21.760 --> 34:22.630
As you command.

34:27.880 --> 34:29.780
Neither sitting nor bowing.

34:30.320 --> 34:32.000
If you marry my daughter,

34:32.000 --> 34:33.199
you'll be my junior.

34:33.230 --> 34:35.230
You're a prince, and I'm an emperor.

34:35.280 --> 34:37.360
There's a distinction
between ruler and subject.

34:37.360 --> 34:38.159
Shouldn't you

34:38.170 --> 34:39.530
bow to me?

35:04.590 --> 35:05.390
Your Majesty,

35:06.920 --> 35:08.320
let tea serve as my drink.

35:08.920 --> 35:11.750
Are you trying to treat me as your equal?

35:12.590 --> 35:14.050
When I marry the princess,

35:14.590 --> 35:18.320
I'll observe the proper etiquette
between father and son-in-law.

35:29.920 --> 35:31.980
Why not wait until the wine's served?

35:34.190 --> 35:35.590
To express my sincerity,

35:36.110 --> 35:37.510
whether it's tea or wine,

35:37.760 --> 35:39.420
what difference does it make?

35:40.220 --> 35:41.180
Try this.

35:58.230 --> 35:59.110
How is it?

36:02.510 --> 36:04.920
Princess Xiyang has a sweet tooth.

36:07.230 --> 36:08.630
How do you know

36:08.710 --> 36:10.910
these are Xiyang's favorite pastries?

36:11.280 --> 36:13.190
Your Majesty is a man of great talent
and broad vision,

36:13.190 --> 36:14.670
with the world in your heart.

36:14.670 --> 36:15.320
Recommending such sweet pastries to me

36:15.320 --> 36:16.740
certainly isn't because

36:16.840 --> 36:18.380
you like them yourself.

36:19.000 --> 36:19.670
I suppose

36:20.190 --> 36:21.670
Your Majesty wants to test

36:21.710 --> 36:23.000
if Princess Xiyang and I

36:23.000 --> 36:24.360
have compatible tastes,

36:24.360 --> 36:24.910
right?

36:26.280 --> 36:29.320
Prince of Zhennan,
you're quite perceptive.

36:29.960 --> 36:31.570
The pastries you just had

36:31.710 --> 36:33.440
were created by Xiyang herself

36:33.510 --> 36:35.370
when she was only seven years old.

36:35.590 --> 36:38.000
Her mother said that as a princess,

36:38.070 --> 36:39.360
she shouldn't be cooking herself

36:39.360 --> 36:41.040
and should let the royal chefs handle it.

36:41.040 --> 36:42.230
But Xiyang insisted

36:43.150 --> 36:44.280
that these pastries

36:44.550 --> 36:46.490
were meant for her family,

36:46.630 --> 36:48.880
and she couldn't entrust them to others.

36:48.880 --> 36:49.580
Therefore,

36:49.710 --> 36:52.040
in this entire world,

36:52.190 --> 36:53.960
only she and her two brothers,

36:54.070 --> 36:56.400
myself, and the Empress have tasted them.

36:56.590 --> 36:58.050
And now, you're the sixth.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.710
It's truly enviable

37:01.960 --> 37:03.420
to hear Your Majesty speak

37:03.630 --> 37:05.110
so fondly of family matters.

37:05.110 --> 37:06.170
I know that

37:06.400 --> 37:08.320
although you and the Emperor of Jinxiu

37:08.320 --> 37:10.320
are brothers, you're not close.

37:10.960 --> 37:13.030
My children are different.

37:13.510 --> 37:15.970
Though they were not born
of the same mother,

37:16.030 --> 37:17.440
their bond as siblings

37:17.480 --> 37:18.540
is deep and strong,

37:18.590 --> 37:19.480
second to none.

37:20.400 --> 37:21.460
That's wonderful.

37:22.280 --> 37:22.840
And?

37:26.480 --> 37:27.840
The marriage between you and Xiyang

37:27.840 --> 37:29.630
was Xiyang's own choice.

37:30.400 --> 37:31.530
I know that

37:31.630 --> 37:34.510
others say Susha was defeated

37:34.590 --> 37:36.660
and could only buy a few years of peace

37:37.030 --> 37:38.930
by marrying off a princess.

37:39.400 --> 37:40.510
They are wrong.

37:43.920 --> 37:45.800
If it weren't for
Xiyang's affection for you,

37:45.800 --> 37:46.630
I would never

37:46.630 --> 37:48.070
trade my beloved daughter's
lifelong happiness

37:48.070 --> 37:49.880
for a few years of peace in Susha.

37:55.510 --> 37:57.780
What I mean is

37:58.280 --> 37:58.800
I

37:59.190 --> 38:01.710
will absolutely not allow Jinxiu
to fail Xiyang.

38:01.710 --> 38:02.710
In this marriage,

38:02.760 --> 38:04.190
what I want is my daughter's

38:04.190 --> 38:05.710
happiness and well-being.

38:05.710 --> 38:06.110
I

38:07.400 --> 38:08.280
will not give you

38:08.280 --> 38:10.140
any chance to disappoint Xiyang.

38:12.630 --> 38:14.230
Your Majesty speaks wisely.

38:14.880 --> 38:16.190
Kingdom affairs are kingdom affairs,

38:16.190 --> 38:18.390
and family matters are family matters.

38:22.280 --> 38:23.760
I won't confuse the two.

38:42.310 --> 38:43.700
[Wutong Mansion]

38:45.150 --> 38:47.810
[Wutong Mansion]

38:45.710 --> 38:46.190
Stop!

38:46.590 --> 38:47.920
This is the First Prince's Residence.

38:47.920 --> 38:49.110
No trespassing allowed!

38:49.110 --> 38:49.770
Step aside.

38:50.230 --> 38:51.760
I'm looking for Feng Suige.

38:51.760 --> 38:52.800
Who do you think you are,

38:52.800 --> 38:55.200
daring to call the First Prince
by his name?

38:55.720 --> 38:56.950
Ning Fei from Jinxiu.

38:57.230 --> 38:57.760
Get lost!

39:01.000 --> 39:01.840
Is Fu Yixiao

39:01.880 --> 39:02.680
here with you?

39:02.760 --> 39:03.820
Get lost, get lost.

39:04.510 --> 39:04.920
You...

39:05.440 --> 39:06.110
Feng Suige!

39:06.320 --> 39:07.960
Feng Suige, come out here!

39:07.990 --> 39:10.520
[Wutong Mansion]

39:08.400 --> 39:09.130
Feng Suige!

39:09.280 --> 39:10.540
I know you're in there.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.800
Why are you making so much noise?

39:13.510 --> 39:14.810
Yixiao needs to rest.

39:15.070 --> 39:15.850
Miss Ling,

39:16.480 --> 39:17.110
it's me,

39:17.710 --> 39:18.910
Ning Fei from Jinxiu.

39:19.070 --> 39:20.190
I don't care who you are.

39:20.190 --> 39:21.760
Stop making such a racket here.

39:21.760 --> 39:23.700
Yixiao is ill and needs rest.

39:26.800 --> 39:28.060
What's wrong with her?

39:28.400 --> 39:30.280
If you're smart, you won't persist.

39:30.280 --> 39:32.030
Her affairs are none of your business.

39:32.030 --> 39:32.710
Just leave.

39:32.750 --> 39:34.320
Yixiao isn't seeing anyone.

39:34.320 --> 39:35.380
Take me to see her.

39:35.590 --> 39:36.550
I'll just take a look at her
from a distance,

39:36.550 --> 39:37.640
without disturbing her any further.

39:37.480 --> 39:40.270
[Wutong Mansion]

39:38.030 --> 39:40.890
-Take your hands off me.
-Who's being so noisy here?

39:47.710 --> 39:49.110
Please step aside, Miss.

39:49.480 --> 39:50.740
I don't want to hurt you.

39:50.740 --> 39:52.070
Hand Yixiao over to me.

39:52.800 --> 39:54.150
Do you want to die?

39:54.550 --> 39:55.990
I'm talking to you!

40:03.540 --> 40:05.700
[Wutong Mansion]

40:06.670 --> 40:09.060
So this is Jinxiu's greatest warrior?

40:10.660 --> 40:12.570
I haven't even said it was on.

40:15.180 --> 40:18.520
[Wutong Mansion]

40:29.800 --> 40:31.540
Greetings, Your Highness.

40:38.880 --> 40:39.800
Mr. Ma,

40:39.820 --> 40:41.950
I'd like a word with Prince of Zhennan.

40:47.760 --> 40:49.290
Greetings, Your Highness.

40:55.110 --> 40:56.510
Do you still remember me?

40:57.120 --> 40:59.000
We've never met before,

40:59.320 --> 41:00.850
so how could I remember you?

41:02.360 --> 41:04.020
So you really don't remember.

41:04.880 --> 41:05.840
Three years ago,

41:06.290 --> 41:08.490
at the border between Jinxiu and Susha,

41:08.550 --> 41:09.400
on the desert.

41:10.000 --> 41:11.840
Prince of Zhennan, you should know that

41:11.840 --> 41:13.590
my father is a warrior emperor

41:13.590 --> 41:15.590
who founded our kingdom
through military might,

41:15.590 --> 41:17.650
and my brother is the commander of
Susha's three armies,

41:17.650 --> 41:19.670
so I can be considered
coming from a military family.

41:19.670 --> 41:21.030
Given my background,

41:21.360 --> 41:22.480
I also thought about achieving glory

41:22.480 --> 41:23.630
on the battlefield

41:23.960 --> 41:25.840
like my father and brother did.

41:26.110 --> 41:27.590
It's not that I enjoy war.

41:28.150 --> 41:29.190
I just believe

41:29.230 --> 41:30.710
that as a princess,

41:31.150 --> 41:33.550
I should do something
to serve our kingdom.

41:33.590 --> 41:35.890
You don't have to go to war
to serve your kingdom.

41:35.890 --> 41:38.020
You have your own duties as a princess.

41:39.070 --> 41:40.260
What you just said

41:40.590 --> 41:41.630
is exactly the same as

41:41.630 --> 41:43.360
what my brother said back then.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.630
Three years ago,

41:44.760 --> 41:46.920
I wanted to follow my brother to battle,

41:46.920 --> 41:48.150
but he wouldn't allow it.

41:48.150 --> 41:49.800
But I was young and impetuous then,

41:49.800 --> 41:51.280
and somehow found the courage

41:51.280 --> 41:53.070
to secretly acquire a suit of armor.

41:53.070 --> 41:53.840
I pulled some strings,

41:53.840 --> 41:55.030
snuck into the army,

41:55.480 --> 41:57.150
and followed the troops into battle.

41:57.150 --> 41:58.400
My brother

41:58.400 --> 42:00.330
started from the bottom level

42:00.840 --> 42:02.630
and made military achievements
step by step

42:02.630 --> 42:04.110
until he became commander.

42:04.110 --> 42:05.600
I wanted to be like him.

42:06.510 --> 42:07.960
But on the second day of the campaign,

42:07.960 --> 42:09.510
I ran into trouble.

42:09.920 --> 42:11.230
I had heard from my brother

42:11.230 --> 42:12.480
that there was a shortcut

42:12.480 --> 42:14.290
in the desert.

42:14.550 --> 42:16.380
To catch up with my brother,

42:16.880 --> 42:18.360
I slipped away from my attendants,

42:18.360 --> 42:20.190
intending to take that shortcut.

42:20.190 --> 42:21.280
Little did I know

42:21.550 --> 42:23.080
I would be completely lost.

42:25.230 --> 42:28.000
What was even more desperate
than my dire situation was

42:28.000 --> 42:29.930
that I was discovered by the enemy.

43:03.550 --> 43:04.480
It's a woman.

43:27.630 --> 43:28.690
I don't kill women.

43:34.030 --> 43:34.560
Let's go.

43:56.530 --> 43:58.570
♪ Flying alone ♪

43:59.050 --> 44:02.640
♪ With no need for direction ♪

44:04.370 --> 44:06.380
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

44:06.870 --> 44:09.340
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

44:11.070 --> 44:12.630
That water pouch saved my life.

44:11.940 --> 44:13.740
♪ Roaming freely ♪

44:13.190 --> 44:14.740
I survived for two more days,

44:14.260 --> 44:18.000
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

44:15.030 --> 44:16.070
until my brother

44:16.070 --> 44:17.070
came to my rescue.

44:18.480 --> 44:20.440
There was a name
carved on that water pouch:

44:19.510 --> 44:21.030
♪ The wet wings ♪

44:20.960 --> 44:22.190
Xia Jingshi.

44:21.830 --> 44:25.320
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

44:24.320 --> 44:25.380
Prince of Zhennan.

44:26.360 --> 44:28.090
It was you who saved me that day,

44:28.320 --> 44:29.710
and it was also you who spared my life.
